{"id":"17.08.TunnelWave","contentHtml":"<p><code>Tunnel Wave</code> is my <strong>first published game on Google Play</strong>, which I independently brought from concept to release.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>As a <strong>Solo Developer</strong>, I was responsible for <strong>100%</strong> of all aspects: from game design and code to monetization, trailer creation, and marketing.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>Challenge</h2>\n<p>The main task was to <strong>independently go through the full cycle of creating and publishing a commercial F2P game</strong>, implementing from scratch not only gameplay but also all accompanying systems: meta-game, monetization, and service integration.</p>\n<h2>Engineering and Product Solution</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Core Mechanics and UX:</strong> Developed <code>one-finger</code> gameplay with <strong>\"instant\" start and finish</strong>. You need to control a worm via a slider. Difficulty increases due to a <strong>dynamically changing tunnel</strong> and a system of <strong>buffs/debuffs</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Meta-Game and Monetization:</strong> Designed the economy, an <strong>in-game store</strong> with customization, and a hybrid monetization model: <code>IAP</code> (currency, No Ads) and three types of ads (Interstitial, Banner, Rewarded).</li>\n<li><strong>Integration and Publishing:</strong> Implemented full support for <strong><code>Google Play Games</code></strong> (leaderboards, achievements, cloud saves). I independently published the game, <strong>created a trailer for it</strong>, and engaged in its <strong>promotion</strong> on 20+ gaming forums.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Outcome</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Game Successfully Published:</strong> The project was completed and <strong>released on Google Play</strong>, becoming my first experience of a full publishing cycle.</li>\n<li><strong>Feature-Complete Product Created:</strong> The game contains all key elements of a commercial F2P arcade, proving my <strong>deep understanding of the mobile market</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Invaluable Experience Gained:</strong> I mastered <mark>all stages of creating and operating a mobile game</mark> in practice: from programming and UX solutions to monetization, publishing, and marketing.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"Tunnel Wave","date":"2017-08","type":"project","tagsArray":["Mobile","Unity","C#","Photoshop","Google Play Games","VFX","Unity Purchasing","Arcade"],"heroVideo":["B7MVkfnw8_E","J8H7G3ZILpA"],"shortDescription":"<p><mark>My first published game on Google Play</mark>. Independently completed the full F2P development cycle: from concept to marketing.</p>\n","role":"solo","storeLinks":["16.09.Realoft","https://apkpure.com/tunnel-wave/com.Realoft.TunnelWave"],"projectIcon":"/images/projects/17.08.TunnelWave/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/17.08.TunnelWave/card.video?v=1765111545165&webm=1&mp4=1","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/17.08.TunnelWave/screenshots/1.webp","width":528,"height":944},{"src":"/images/projects/17.08.TunnelWave/screenshots/2.webp","width":2150,"height":3840},{"src":"/images/projects/17.08.TunnelWave/screenshots/3.webp","width":2150,"height":3840},{"src":"/images/projects/17.08.TunnelWave/screenshots/4.webp","width":2150,"height":3840},{"src":"/images/projects/17.08.TunnelWave/screenshots/5.webp","width":528,"height":944},{"src":"/images/projects/17.08.TunnelWave/screenshots/6.webp","width":528,"height":944}]}